The English first-name table in
coref/src/main/resources/opennlp/tools/coref/first-names-en.txt
is an Apache-licensed project derivative of the United States Social Security
Administration national baby-name data for 1920 through 2008. The source data are
United States government material published at https://www.ssa.gov/oact/babynames/.
SSA describes its government documents as public domain at
https://www.ssa.gov/websitepolicies.htm.
